          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu haahingwireho omwaka gumu, ihe ly'Abasiriya likaaseesira Yowaasi. Baahika Yuda na Yerusaalemu, baiha omu bantu abanyoro b'abantu boona, baabahwerekereza, omunyago gwabo gwona, baagutwekera omukama wa Damasiko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ihe ry'Abasiriya noobwakubaire likaba lirumu abantu bake, MUKAMA akaliha kusingura ihe erikooto, habwokuba abantu bakarugaho MUKAMA Ruhanga owa baisenkurubo. Nukwo baaleetire Yowaasi bati ekifubiro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
