          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu baamazire kumurugaho, baasiga ahutaire muno, habw'esagama ya mutabani wa Yehoyaada nyakatagara, abaheereza be baayekoba kumukora akabi nukwo kumwitira ha kitabu kye. Nukwo yafiire ati; baamuziika omu rubuga rwa Daudi, baitu batamuziike omu magasani g'abakama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Banu nubo abaamuliiraine: Zebadi mutabani wa Omwamonikati, na Yehozabadi mutabani wa Simulisi, Omwamowabbukati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebyafaayo by'abatabani ba Yowaasi, n'ebindi ebyamugambirweho, n'ebyokwombeka buhyaka Enju ya Ruhanga, bikahandiikwa omu makuru ag'ekitabu ky'Abakama. Omutabani Amaziya yalema omu kiikaro kye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.27"
            ]
          }
        }
